title Fixly v2 - Device Journey from Order to Installation

Procurement [color: yellow, icon: file-text] {
  Need Identified [shape: oval]
  Create Purchase Order
  Approve PO
  Vendor Ships Devices
  Goods Receipt GRN
  QC Check [shape: diamond]
  Return to Vendor
  Register Devices with Serial and Warranty
}

Platform Inventory [color: purple, icon: archive] {
  Platform Stock
  Allocate to Company
  Dispatch to Company
}

Company Inventory [color: blue, icon: building] {
  Company Receives
  Company Stock
  Allocate to Client
  Dispatch to Client
}

Client Inventory [color: green, icon: map-pin] {
  Client Receives
  Client Stock
  Assign to Zone and Technician
}

Field Installation [color: red, icon: camera] {
  Technician Installs in Zone
  Commission and Test
  Installed and Active [shape: oval]
}

Operations [color: orange, icon: activity] {
  Daily Status Log
  Device Healthy [shape: diamond]
  Issue Raised
  Fault Handling Flow [shape: oval]
}

Need Identified > Create Purchase Order
Create Purchase Order > Approve PO
Approve PO > Vendor Ships Devices
Vendor Ships Devices > Goods Receipt GRN
Goods Receipt GRN > QC Check
QC Check > Register Devices with Serial and Warranty: Accepted
QC Check > Return to Vendor: Rejected
Register Devices with Serial and Warranty > Platform Stock
Platform Stock > Allocate to Company
Allocate to Company > Dispatch to Company
Dispatch to Company > Company Receives: In Transit
Company Receives > Company Stock
Company Stock > Allocate to Client
Allocate to Client > Dispatch to Client
Dispatch to Client > Client Receives: In Transit
Client Receives > Client Stock
Client Stock > Assign to Zone and Technician
Assign to Zone and Technician > Technician Installs in Zone
Technician Installs in Zone > Commission and Test
Commission and Test > Installed and Active
Installed and Active > Daily Status Log
Daily Status Log > Device Healthy
Device Healthy > Daily Status Log: Yes
Device Healthy > Issue Raised: No
Issue Raised > Fault Handling Flow
